      "cooked": "<p>I know Christmas is the big holiday to shoot for, but Hanukkah starts December 16. Any chance for some WotC goodness by then? &nbsp;There is an 8 day window for Hanukkah and I can always give a card saying WotC, but I would love to be playing it with them over the winter break.&nbsp;</p>",
